# Accessibility

- Icon-only controls need `aria-label`.
- Focus style is `focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50`.
- Interactive targets are at least 24px.
- Never nest interactive elements. A clear control sits beside the trigger, not inside it.
- Use `--input` for control edges. Decorative borders stay `--border`.
- Name every dialog, chart, carousel, and progress bar (`aria-label` or a title).
